🐛 Describe the bug
It's entirely possible this is user error, and fully understand if what I'm providing below isn't sufficient for proper debugging. My config is large and would prefer, if possible, to share the full log and cmake config privately.
What's noteworthy is I'm (obviously) building with:
 -DSTATIC_DISPATCH_BACKEND="CPU;CUDA"
 -DUSE_LIGHTWEIGHT_DISPATCH=ON
While compiling torch from source with Clang, I get the following:
...
